<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= title %> | AptitudePro</title><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#08111f;color:#eaf2ff;font:16px/1.5 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:32px 20px}.back{color:#8fdcff;text-decoration:none}.hero,.card{background:#101d30;border:1px solid #253650;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;margin-top:20px}.hero h1{margin:8px 0;color:white}.hero p,.card p{color:#a9b7ca}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:16px}.btn{display:inline-flex;margin-top:12px;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:9px;background:#1fa5d9;color:#04111c;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}.muted{font-size:.9rem;color:#92a1b5}@media(max-width:560px){.wrap{padding:20px 14px}.hero,.card{padding:18px}}
</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><a class="back" href="/placement/college/company/accenture">← Accenture practice</a><section class="hero"><h1><%= interview ? 'Interview Preparation' : 'Communication Assessment' %></h1><p><%= interview ? 'Practice HR, technical, behavioral and project questions. Use a specific example and explain your contribution.' : 'Practice professional workplace communication. Written responses are saved for your review; automated evaluation is not enabled.' %></p></section>
<div class="grid"><% if (!interview) { %><article class="card"><h2>Professional Email Writing</h2><p>Write a clear workplace email for a realistic scenario. Your response is saved without an invented score.</p><a class="btn" href="/accenture/communication/task">Start writing</a></article><article class="card"><h2>Objective Communication</h2><p>Practice grammar, vocabulary and workplace response questions when available.</p><a class="btn" href="/quiz?learningPath=college&placementType=company&company=accenture&mode=accenture&sectionKey=communication-objective">Practice questions</a></article><% } else { %><article class="card"><h2>HR and Behavioral</h2><p>Prepare concise answers about strengths, teamwork, conflict and goals.</p><a class="btn" href="/accenture/interview/task">Practice a question</a></article><article class="card"><h2>Technical and Project</h2><p>Explain architecture, technology choices, testing and trade-offs clearly.</p><a class="btn" href="/accenture/interview/task">Practice a question</a></article><% } %></div><p class="muted">Question formats and selection are practice configurations; assessment invitations vary by role and drive.</p></main></body></html>
